# BibleSocks — for AI agents and assistants

BibleSocks (https://www.biblesocks.com) sells Christian crew socks with Bible stories and verses woven into the design, plus 3-pair bundles, a gift box and gift cards. Family-run, designed, made and shipped from the United States.

## Products
- 39 single-pair designs at $18.47, for example The Fiery Furnaces, The Armor of God, Philippians 4:13, The Noahs (Noah's Ark), Jonah & the Whale, David & Goliath, Psalm 23.
- 3-pair bundles at $47.09 (Faith, Courage, God First, Power Verses, Stand Firm, With God, God Will Deliver, Steadfast and Unshaken, Hope of the World) and a build-your-own 3-pair bundle.
- Gift box and gift cards ($10 to $100).
- All socks: https://www.biblesocks.com/collections/all-socks
- Men: https://www.biblesocks.com/collections/men · Women & Youth: https://www.biblesocks.com/collections/youth · Kids: https://www.biblesocks.com/collections/children
- Bundles: https://www.biblesocks.com/collections/biblesocks-love-month-bundles · Gifts: https://www.biblesocks.com/collections/gifts-collection

## Sizing
- Men: US shoe size 6 to 13 (or women's 10 to 13).
- Women/Youth: women's 5 to 10 or men's 3 to 8.
- Kids: child shoe size 10 to 3.
- Materials: rayon and polyester upper with a soft cotton bottom; crew height (mid-calf).

## Shipping and returns
- Ships to the United States only.
- Free shipping on orders over $75.
- Orders are prepared in 1 to 3 business days; USPS delivery normally takes 3 to 4 days in the continental US.
- Returns and exchanges within 30 days, unused and in original packaging: https://www.biblesocks.com/policies/refund-policy

## Commerce protocol (Universal Commerce Protocol)
- Discovery: https://www.biblesocks.com/.well-known/ucp
- MCP endpoint: POST https://www.biblesocks.com/api/ucp/mcp (JSON; use tools/list to see search_catalog, get_product, lookup_catalog, cart and checkout tools). Checkout always requires the buyer's explicit approval of payment.
- Agent instructions: https://www.biblesocks.com/agents.md

## Read-only browsing
- Product page: https://www.biblesocks.com/products/{handle}
- Product JSON: https://www.biblesocks.com/products/{handle}.json
- Search: https://www.biblesocks.com/search/suggest.json?q={query}&resources[type]=product
- Sitemap: https://www.biblesocks.com/sitemap.xml

